			"Message": "feat(Mountain,Wind): Sync submodule updates with layout/extension services and build config\n\nSynchronize Mountain and Wind submodules to their latest downstream versions:\n\nMountain (20b9363): Revert production profile names to simple Mountain identifier - restore binary, library, and default-run targets to use \"Mountain\" instead of verbose production profile string. Update tauri.conf.json productName and identifier, remove duplicate externalBin entry, and delete redundant backup files.\n\nWind (12507057): Add four new workbench-tier Effect-TS service layers:\n- WorkbenchContextKeyService: Context key value management and expression evaluation\n- WorkbenchExtensionService: Extension activation and snapshot management\n- WorkbenchLayoutService: Workbench part visibility controls (ActivityBar, Sidebar, Panel, StatusBar)\n- WorkbenchProgressProblem: Problem ADT for progress task failures\n- Complete WorkbenchEditorService with Live implementation for pane management\n\nAll services follow Wind's established pattern with BridgeShape, Service, Tag, Problem ADT, and Live runtime bridge implementation via globalThis.__CEL_SERVICES_.",
			"SHA": "d0eeeb8b75ced8842c1a7bbcb69d3a4884f74d5c"
