				28,
				1
			],
			"Message": "feat(Wind): Add WorkbenchActivity and WorkbenchEditor services\n\nAdd two new workbench-tier Effect-TS service layers bridging VS Code's native\nactivity and editor services to Wind's service architecture:\n\nWorkbenchActivityService:\n- Manages activity badges for view containers, views, accounts, and global activity\n- Provides ShowBadge (disposable badge with count/text/priority) and Clear operations\n- Problem ADT: WorkbenchActivityBridgeUnavailable, WorkbenchActivityRefused\n\nWorkbenchEditorService:\n- Bridges VS Code's native editor service for pane management\n- Provides Active (current editor snapshot), Open, CloseActive, and OnActiveChange stream\n- Open accepts resource URI with options for preserveFocus, preview, pinned, columnIndex\n- Problem ADT: WorkbenchEditorBridgeUnavailable, WorkbenchEditorOpenFailed, WorkbenchEditorCloseFailed\n\nBoth services follow the established Wind pattern with BridgeShape (upstream typed interface), Service (abstract contract), Tag (Context.Tag for DI), Problem (ADT for errors), and Live (runtime bridge implementation via globalThis.__CEL_SERVICES_).",
			"SHA": "6128caf49144c295618b6f88450747a4c4625b9c"
		},
