				"⠁⠀⠀⠀⠀",
				28,
				1
			],
			"Message": "feat(Wind): Add codegen emission layer for service schemas and catalog\n\nAdd the code emission layer to Wind's VS Code service codegen pipeline, completing Phase-2 of the system:\n- Codegen.ts: Runnable entry point invoked by prepublishOnly.sh\n- RunCodegen.ts: Orchestrator that walks source tree, extracts decorators, emits schemas\n- EmitServiceSchema.ts: Per-service schema emitter - writes `<Decorator>Upstream.ts` files with typed interface members and source-line back-links\n- EmitServiceCatalog.ts: Catalog emitter - writes ServiceCatalog.ts index of all discovered decorators with metadata\n- index.ts: Public exports for library consumers\n\nThe emission layer takes the ServiceDecoratorRecord extraction results from Phase-1 (added in previous commit) and produces typed TypeScript files under Effect/Generated/ that Wind bridge shapes can import type from. Schema files are idempotent (byte-identical on re-run) with diff-friendly formatting: members sorted by source line, JSDoc preserved verbatim.\n\nRefs: Land/.claude/tauri/Patches/14-StreamingGRPC.md",
			"SHA": "89d68124f9ca9c3443180c16819d407bc3492d4f"
		},
