			"Message": "feat(Element): Sync submodule updates with codegen pipeline and production build config\n\nSynchronize multiple Element submodules to their latest downstream versions:\n\n- Mountain (16bcfef9): Update binary/lib names and Tauri config for production build profile. Rename the Mountain binary and library to include the full production environment profile string (ProductionNodeEnvironment_MicrosoftVSCodeDependency_22NodeVersion_Bundle_Clean_Compile_ElectronProfile_EsbuildCompiler_Mountain) to distinguish this build variant from development builds. Update tauri.conf.json productName and identifier, and add Binary/node to externalBin for production node path.\n\n- Wind (c4fc5b33): Add VS Code service decorator codegen pipeline and global bridge accessor. Add a new regex-based codegen system that walks the VS Code source tree and extracts `createDecorator(...)` sites with interface members: ExtractDecoratorMatch, ExtractInterfaceMembers, IterateServiceDecorators, SourceTreeWalker. Also adds LandWorkbenchGlobal.ts - typed wrapper around globalThis.__CEL_WIND__ exposing CELWind().RunPromise(...) for Sky consumers.\n\n- Cocoon: Submodule pointer update.\n\nThis synchronization delivers the Wind codegen infrastructure for automated bridge shape generation from upstream VS Code source, while configuring Mountain for production build profile separation.",
			"SHA": "ed7b93f4835433642564a6494d448807fb15e5ff"
